        Target SNOMED CT 443532 = sctid 406445001. Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps base W94
        (concept_id 45756338) -> 443532 (relationship 45756338, 443532); it is the authoritative
        standard concept for W94 and fully subsumes every place/activity-specific SE subdivision.
