mapping "W9403.1" source="W9403" target="406445001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W9403 SNOMED CT 406445001 is a Swedish national extension of WHO base Exposure to high and
        low air pressure and changes in air pressure (ICD-10 id 45756338); the Swedish suffix subdivides
        the base by a place/activity external-cause axis with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical
        analogue. Base event Athena-crosswalks to SNOMED CT 443532 (concept_code 406445001) via ICD10
        relationship 45756338 -> 443532. The Swedish place/activity qualifier is external-cause
        metadata; the injury event is unchanged. Target subsumes the event -> broader. Confidence :
        verified Athena crosswalk on the WHO base, one-level broader (qualifier dropped).
        """
}
